<BaseLayout title="About">
  <article class="narrow">
    <p class="eyebrow">About</p>
    <h1>I build software that has somewhere to go.</h1>
    <div class="prose">
      <p>I'm Muhammad Habib ur Rehman Khan, a Backend / Full-Stack Developer focused on Python and Django. My work spans production business systems, REST APIs, background processing, AI integrations, dashboards, and mobile-facing backends.</p>
      <p>Alongside professional work, I build and ship my own products. EzTajweed is a published Quran learning application, while EzClip is an AI video generation platform built around asynchronous processing, generated media, and live progress tracking.</p>
      <p>I also write about the things I learn and build. This site brings those articles together with the projects and systems behind them.</p>
      <p>Interested in working together? <a href="/contact/">Start a conversation →</a></p>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
